# Comparison Table

| Method          | Time Complexity | Space Complexity | Best Use Case              |
| --------------- | --------------- | ---------------- | -------------------------- |
| Sorting         | O(n log n)      | O(n)             | Simple interviews          |
| Frequency Array | O(n)            | O(1)             | Lowercase English letters  |
| HashMap         | O(n)            | O(k)             | Unicode/general characters |

